Due to the length and complexity of this project, I decided to organize the code in a better way than just a single main.py file.

utils.py: contains the helper functions mostly necessary in part 1 and 2.1
convolution.py: contains the code for part 1 and 2.1
hybrid_image_starter.py: contains the code for part 2.2
stacks.py: contains the code necessary in part 2.3 and 2.4

Here is where I have setup the files in my directory in order for the image paths to work correctly:
